WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.402
pdfoxium
Read, search, annotate and interact — powered by safe Rust

00:00:01.402 --> 00:00:11.698
Read and navigate
Bookmarks, page previews, links and crisp zoom

00:00:11.698 --> 00:00:18.285
PDF layers
Toggle map details without changing the document

00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:25.760
Find and select
Search from the current page; copy continuous text selections

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:36.983
Annotate and save
Markup, notes, styled text and shapes — move, resize, save

00:00:36.983 --> 00:00:43.371
Edit the document
Insert images, rotate pages and import another PDF

00:00:43.371 --> 00:00:50.649
Forms + JavaScript
Type, choose and check — with live currency formatting

00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:55.392
Interactive XFA
Real widgets, data binding and JavaScript actions

00:00:55.392 --> 00:00:59.861
Dynamic XFA
Add rows; pages and live previews follow the new layout

00:00:59.861 --> 00:01:06.192
PDF animation
Click to play and pause — JavaScript timers and live previews

00:01:06.192 --> 00:01:07.704
Try pdfoxium
cargo run --release -p pdfoxium-viewer
